# Referral short links — must be a redirect (not a 200 rewrite): a rewrite
# leaves the browser's visible URL at /ref/:code with no query string, so
# ref.html's client-side `URLSearchParams(location.search).get('code')`
# never sees the code and bounces to /index.html. A 301 lands the browser on
# the query-string form ref.html already parses correctly. (2026-08-05)
/ref/:code  /ref.html?code=:code  301
https://stellaredgeservices.com/* /stellar-edge.html 200
https://www.stellaredgeservices.com/* /stellar-edge.html 200
